          A curved treadmill goes exactly as fast as you push it, which makes it brilliant for some sessions and awkward for others. Here are four workouts that play to its strengths — sprint repeats, tempo, sled-style pushes and walking intervals — and a six-week progression that builds into them without wrecking your calves.
