          <a href="#sprint-repeats" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Session One: Sprint Repeats</a>
          <a href="#tempo" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. Session Two: Tempo Running on a Curve</a>
          <a href="#sled-push" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. Session Three: Sled-Push Style Work</a>
          <a href="#walking-intervals" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. Session Four: Walking Intervals</a>
          <a href="#progression" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. A Six-Week Progression</a>
          <a href="#fitting-it-in" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. Fitting Curved Sessions Into a Week, and When to Back Off</a>
          <a href="#what-to-buy" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. What to Buy: Choosing a Curved Trainer for These Sessions</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">11. Frequently Asked Questions</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
