        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">A curved treadmill is built for short, hard efforts with full
            recovery.</strong> Sprint repeats of 8 to 20 seconds, sled-style pushes on machines with
            resistance, and tempo broken into blocks are the sessions that suit it; walking intervals
            are the way in and the easy day between.
          </p>
